d for training and culinary development, so we have ample space to prepare sandwiches quickly and safely at our facility.  Our operations team has been certified in safe serv and can provide oversight to other team members to ensure that quality standards are met.  Please feel free to contact me (John Stern-CEO) at the number included.  I will be your primary contact along with Christina Jockwig, our VP of Marketing and Digital Content.  We look forward to serving the Atlanta Community in this very worthwhile endeavor.
