NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, '2025-11-14T00:00:00.000Z', 'sent', 'user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '11.14 / Randy scheduled a call, will be meeting with him on Tuesday at 10am / 11.18 Spoke with Rady he''s having the event today, asked how many sandwiches is he making? Randy said, he''s making 100, advised in that case he doesn''t need to request for an event since it''s not 200+, explained of host home process and to reach out to see if they would be able to accept drop offs today. He understood and was grateful. Advised for future reference to request the event 2 weeks in advance so it allow us time to coordinate, he understood. Asked how he heard about us? He said, there was a project back at his university where they were making sandwiches, and he thought it would be a good idea since they wanted to have some community service. Advised we are grateful for it also provide him instructions in how to do them, the refrigeration, and to take pictures so he can send it over to me. / Followed up with him to see if he was able to get in touch with the host home, he said, he was able to get ahold of Jordan and will be dropping the sandwiches this afternoon', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{}', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, '', 0, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '103', 'auto-cmFuZHkucnVkdWxwaEBt', '2025-11-12T14:11:14.376Z', NULL, NULL, '2025-11-12T09:07:22.000Z', '2025-11-21T19:44:28.978Z', 'google_sheets_sync', 0, 'small_medium_corp', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '33.8931895', '-84.3052756', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
