er_1758479940045_duyek8qnv', '11:00', '13:00', '1:00 PM', '2025-11-15T13:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'They need one driver to pick up the sandwiches. Everything else is good. She wanted to know if we are able to provide proof of service hours for the school. Advised to reach out to the school and see what they need, whether that''s an email or document and I can see what we can do. She will definitely reach out back to us. / 10.30.25 Updated her time, now it''s going from 11-1pm, I''m still trying to get her location / 11.04.25 Lindsay sent the address and she said, she''s planning to make sandwiches with her son tomorrow, advised to reach out the closest host location so she can drop them off, understood', '"[{\"type\":\"deli_turkey\",\"quantity\":100},{\"type\":\"deli_ham\",\"quantity\":100}]"'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '{"host-contact-4"}', NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"custom:Shady Grove Baptist Church"}', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, '', 0, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '43', 'auto-bGluZHNheV9taWNoYWVs', '2025-10-23T11:24:43.659Z', '{"host-contact-4":{"name":"host-contact-4","assignedAt":"2025-11-13T02:46:44.456Z","assignedBy":"admin_1756853839752"}}'::jsonb, NULL, '2025-10-21T09:50:09.000Z', '2025-11-17T02:32:26.779Z', 'google_sheets_sync', 10, 'school', 'private', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, TRUE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '33.989958', '-84.4557533', FALSE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
