ere at the Augusta University campus in the morning and then work with you guys to find the best way to drop them off. Thank you so much for your time and I look forward to the possibility of working with you guys!', 'i_dont_know', 'postponed', '2025-10-29T02:38:02.527Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'user_1756855614444_qblv41at2', '2025-09-30T19:27:20.375Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, '2025-09-30T00:00:00.000Z', 'sent', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christine emailed tool kit and asked for them to call Marcy to discuss event and placement in Augusta', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{}', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, '', 0, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '11', 'auto-emNvbGxpbnNAYXVndXN0', '2025-10-23T11:24:41.413Z', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-29T18:27:54.000Z', '2025-10-29T02:38:02.527Z', 'google_sheets_sync', 0, 'school', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
