 Shallowford Rd, Atlanta, GA 30345', 500, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv', '2025-10-27T19:30:56.425Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, '2025-10-27T12:00:00.000Z', 'sent', NULL, '16:30', '17:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'We could have 2 speakers - 1 for the children and another for the adults, since they will be in two different rooms - We also need a driver', 'I have scheduled a call Thursday 10:30am - Oct 30th / 10.30.25 Spoke with Landon regarding the event went over the food safety guidelines, the chuch has lots of refrigerators so it wouldn''t be an issue in case they need to leave them for the night. Requested TSP rep since it''s a large event. Spoke with Christine regarding the event since there are multiples happening the same date, she mentioned due to potential snap cuts we need the event. Spoke with Landon to let her know the event has been approved. She was grateful and excited.', '"[{\"type\":\"deli\",\"quantity\":500}]"'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 1, NULL, '{"444"}', NULL, NULL, FALSE, '{"user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv"}', NULL, NULL, '{"host:16"}', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, 32, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, '', 0, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '53', 'auto-bGRpbGxhcmRAc2hhbGxv', '2025-10-27T18:52:29.847Z', '{"444":{"name":"John Stembel","assignedAt":"2025-11-07T04:23:36.133Z","assignedBy":"admin_1756853839752"}}'::jsonb, '{"user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv":{"name":"Brigith Gonzalez","assignedAt":"2025-11-03T01:43:09.539Z","assignedBy":"admin_1756853839752"}}'::jsonb, '2025-10-27T14:49:28.000Z', '2025-11-10T00:01:20.479Z', 'google_sheets_sync', 32, 'church_faith', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, TRUE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '33.8574578', '-84.2820284', FALSE, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N