Event Location: Marietta, GA', 'i_dont_know', 'declined', '2025-12-03T16:13:16.848Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Marietta, GA', 150, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv', '2025-12-01T19:00:57.579Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, '2025-12-02T00:00:00.000Z', 'sent', 'user_1758479940045_duyek8qnv', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.03 I had a meeting with her, she was a bit confused about the process and what she needed to do. She said, she will do the minimum to have the event which is 200, she was thinking on different locations. Asked if she had refrigeration? she said, she can use the coolers, advised it needs to be refrigirator for safety reasons. She said, she will be able to do it at her house then, she asked if she can drop it off anytime at the location? advised it depends on the host home. She can reach out to them and see if they will be available certain day. She understood, I sent her over the website, she was grateful, she ended up staying she will do around 150 in that case, advised that was fine, went over intake, how to make a sandwich and safety precautions. Advised for future reference if she is making less than 200 she doesn''t need to request an event, she can just communicate with the host home, but in case she''s doing 200+, she needs to reach out to us so we can plan accordingly. She understood. Also, I let her know if she could take pics about the event that''d be great and we can also collaborate in Instagram, she liked the idea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{}', FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, '', 0, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24', 'auto-YnJpdHRhbnltYWVnYXdh', '2025-12-01T18:29:18.193Z', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-01T07:40:06.000Z', '2025-12-03T16:13:16.849Z', 'google_sheets_sync', 0, NULL,