Hello, 

I hope you are well! My name is Inaara Jiwani, and I serve as a local representative for Ismaili CIVIC. 

Ismaili CIVIC is a global program under which the Shia Ismaili Muslim community across the world has united around its centuries-old tradition of serving humanity by rendering voluntary service to improve the quality of life in the communities in which they live- regardless of faith, gender, and background. 

We would love to partner with The Sandwich Project as we are hoping to host a volunteer event at our Jamatkhana (place of worship) on 01/10/2025. We partnered together last year and our event was such a success! 

Please let me know if this is possible and if you have any questions! I would be happy to hop on a call if needed! I look forward to hearing from you soon!

